<p local-id=3D"6c6045762396"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"a407ede927f4" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-1.ExecutiveSu=
mmary">1. Executive Summary</h1>
<p local-id=3D"6098011e4288">This document defines the business requirement=
s for the Enforcement Agent Master Data Platform, which aims to consolidate=
 and centralise Enforcement Agent (EA) information into a single master sys=
tem. It establishes a Single Source of Truth (SSOT), drives data integratio=
n and governance, ensures completeness and accuracy of EA profiles, and ali=
gns processes and reporting with the master data to improve reliability and=
 compliance.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"e2baefc118dc" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-2.BusinessCon=
text&amp;Background">2. Business Context &amp; Background</h1>
<p local-id=3D"beb10b3cb451">Current EA information is fragmented across mu=
ltiple legacy systems (optimise, Columbus, Advance, Asset.), causing duplic=
ate entries, inconsistencies, manual reconciliation, process inefficiencies=
, and risk exposure. A unified EA data platform will remove these silos, st=
andardise attributes, simplify agent management across enforcement processe=
s, IT , payroll, and reporting.</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"5a4719e35508" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-3.BusinessObj=
ectives">3. Business Objectives</h1>
<p local-id=3D"7cad6568d960">The platform shall achieve the following objec=
tives:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"a347143ead74">
<li local-id=3D"0f8b9ab44aaa">
<p local-id=3D"4d29fbbaa6f0">Establish a Single Source of Truth (SSOT) for =
Enforcement Agent Data: Create a single, authoritative Master EA Database t=
hat eliminates fragmented, inconsistent, and duplicated EA information acro=
ss all operational and legacy systems. 100% of downstream systems must cons=
ume EA data exclusively from the Master Record.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7e59f5dd1f20">
<p local-id=3D"4e7acc9b755b">Ensure Seamless, Real-Time Integration and Syn=
c Transparency Across All Systems: Design and implement a resilient, uni-di=
rectional integration framework that ensures updates propagate reliably to =
all dependent systems in real-time or within defined SLAs. A visible sync h=
ealth dashboard shall be provided at the EA record level.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a496f1d94b56">
<p local-id=3D"1dd7d4bd8d76">Implement Robust Data Governance, Compliance, =
and Security Controls: Enforce role-based access control (RBAC), dual-appro=
val workflow (Keyer/Verifier) for sensitive changes, a comprehensive audit =
trail for all actions, and automated retention, archival, and leaver-handli=
ng processes.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7122413e4830">
<p local-id=3D"c60da2c63253">Maintain a Complete, Standardised, 360=C2=B0 E=
nforcement Agent Profile: Capture every critical attribute required for ope=
rational processes. Every active EA must have a complete, validated, and up=
-to-date profile.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"899bbf7fdff7">
<p local-id=3D"319760c70a23">Align Operational Processes, Workflows, and Re=
porting with the Master EA Data Model: Modernise and harmonise business pro=
cesses across Enforcement Operations, HR, Compliance, Payroll, and field ma=
nagement to rely solely on the Master EA Record.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"f433155cadd9"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"b29db02138b4" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-4.Scope">4. S=
cope</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"d6d380cf8f05" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-InScope">In S=
cope</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"25aa79b91462">
<li local-id=3D"7f25f86bc5c0">
<p local-id=3D"0583aff40f2a">Centralised EA system design and implementatio=
n</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"183ca3eeb1d9">
<p local-id=3D"5c3a91c30cae">Integration with all consuming systems via API=
 and real-time sync</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"50792ffd813b">
<p local-id=3D"ad0bce462a69">Data Governance, Security, and Compliance feat=
ures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"37055a1093e4">
<p local-id=3D"bef3aa9f2030">Complete EA profile data model and mandatory f=
ields enforcement</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2a6faefd03fe">
<p local-id=3D"29f22d57cd9f"><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=
=3D"567ac3ca-59be-4825-81bd-1e59fc7332a2">Leaver handling, data retention a=
nd archival processes</span></p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"925017ea2feb" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-OutofScope">O=
ut of Scope</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"9b825401adb6">
<li local-id=3D"bb30f05dc6ee">
<p local-id=3D"b479de8452f5">Changes to non-EA data domains (e.g. Debtor da=
ta, Case data)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c9cf3c2cc7e">
<p local-id=3D"fbc77b4747dc">Enhancements outside EA integration and govern=
ance</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ef1b5f4f1ce0">
<p local-id=3D"25ee03bd62a2">Existing Advance Data migration to Master EA</=
p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"8b1b34f7d14f">&nbsp;</p>
<h1 local-id=3D"e1089f9f99ad" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-5.As-IsProces=
s">5. <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"2be72364-b396-41e4-=
9ecd-237ea59219e8">As-Is Proce</span>ss</h1>
<p local-id=3D"88c3aac2e6dc">The EA onboarding process begins when the Adva=
nce system receives EA onboarding details from the Talos system, such as na=
me, contact information, and address. If the data is successfully received,=
 the EA profile is automatically populated in Advance. If the details are n=
ot received, the Advance user manually creates the EA profile.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9ebe6caa6699">Once the EA profile is available through eithe=
r method, the entity setup is completed by adding certificate, contract, an=
d bond details. After the setup is completed, reports are automatically gen=
erated (daily, weekly, or monthly) and shared with relevant teams such as F=
inance and Fleet.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-=
left-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embe=
dded-image image-left" alt=3D"MasterEAASIS.drawio (3).svg" width=3D"468" lo=
ading=3D"lazy" src=3D"7d8d9cd333c5d031c6f6578832e4ea3e119c0cd55c40617dca3bb=
fcada0f557f" data-image-src=3D"https://marston.atlassian.net/wiki/download/=
attachments/1862205441/MasterEAASIS.drawio%20(3).svg?version=3D1&amp;modifi=
cationDate=3D1776068663793&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=
=3D"186" data-width=3D"904" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked=
-resource-id=3D"1869774863" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-=
resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"MasterEA=
ASIS.drawio (3).svg" data-base-url=3D"https://marston.atlassian.net/wiki" d=
ata-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/svg+xml" data-linked-resource-con=
tainer-id=3D"1862205441" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10" data=
-media-id=3D"1d2f04a0-983f-47da-a4aa-3c812f43033b" data-media-type=3D"file"=
 height=3D"96"></span>
<p local-id=3D"ab82472ab19f"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"5f273d8c65e4" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-7.BusinessFlo=
w(To-Be)">7. <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"214f06e1-9dd=
e-4ac1-8bf3-048afd8dc5ad">Business Flow (To-Be)</span></h1>
<p local-id=3D"a680fc3e5d6f">In the To-be state, EA onboarding is initiated=
 in the Advance platform where the keyer creates or updates EA details incl=
uding IT setup and enforcement information. The verifier then reviews and a=
pproves the data. Upon approval, the Master EA Platform acting as the singl=
e source of truth automatically syncs the updated data to three integrated =
systems: Asset Register (MAS), Optimise, and Columbus, eliminating manual h=
andoffs.</p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-left-wrap=
per confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-imag=
e image-left" alt=3D"MasterEAToBe (1).drawio (1).svg" width=3D"468" loading=
=3D"lazy" src=3D"e20adc31ad623847d4014cba1e93e6aabb8c0cfa2edc8af85bbcb8c378=
fb12b8" data-image-src=3D"https://marston.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attac=
hments/1862205441/MasterEAToBe%20(1).drawio%20(1).svg?version=3D1&amp;modif=
icationDate=3D1776066357706&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=
=3D"326" data-width=3D"1123" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linke=
d-resource-id=3D"1869119495" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked=
-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"MasterE=
AToBe (1).drawio (1).svg" data-base-url=3D"https://marston.atlassian.net/wi=
ki" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/svg+xml" data-linked-resourc=
e-container-id=3D"1862205441" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"10"=
 data-media-id=3D"56100f61-0ced-4e5c-9e3d-b3595cb1f23a" data-media-type=3D"=
file" height=3D"135"></span>
<h1 local-id=3D"82db301746ac" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-8.High-LevelB=
usinessRequirements">8. High-Level Business Requirements</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1064" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"7463fa92-04e0-4fbe-b13c-ffdc49928ad3" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 101.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 963.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9d8a615d-0579-49a0-8500-5c2ccf10987d">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"d025c883-380d-4987-b=
1c7-57d5c47ccacf" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b7947f8ee9c2"><strong> ID</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f4f5f7" data-local-id=3D"eef24ef6-594b-4c83-8=
790-04b6bccdcf83" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3dc885373760"><strong>REQUIREMENT</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b09b1149-217b-476b-b01a-01f7aac822b5">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"82f7c767-4536-434b-8=
a5a-488ad82b226c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"90636e64c168"><strong>BR-01</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"696901d7-1b24-4f01-87e1-97075bfbde29" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7c0b8f641e36">The system shall consolidate all EA records in=
to a single Master EA Database, eliminating fragmented data across Optimise=
, Columbus, Advance, MHL Portal (Asset Register).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"df0c3b79-21c7-41b3-a4b5-b72448e98d7a">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"b855bf27-2ea9-40a1-a=
3dd-2de482bfaec2" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"370511659479"><strong>BR-02</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"879bb1fe-4f8f-4162-9cee-5aeafc8c4b2d" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a45d3fec9680">The system shall enforce mandatory field compl=
etion and validation rules for every EA record (personal identifiers, contr=
act status, certification, asset assignments).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"094d4f57-d83c-45be-bfca-2f8f107279c4">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"068d0a77-7216-4779-9=
c41-10053b3ad366" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5a87a4bb1319"><strong>BR-03</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b922195e-ad80-4e54-84e1-5458091653a8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"22f5f14c5909">Any EA record created, updated, or deactivated=
 in the Master EA Database shall be automatically propagated to all consumi=
ng downstream systems in near real-time or within defined SLAs.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3e658361-cf7e-4828-bbf0-bff59bac0101">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"8f5ad94b-6c31-4b6a-9=
b2f-79fd6653d276" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0d7b3d0e3ef7"><strong>BR-04</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"4afcab39-da27-4414-9d4f-613193bdc3aa" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bc657080947e">The system shall provide a unified, read-only =
360=C2=B0 EA Profile View for inquiry and operational users without edit pe=
rmissions.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cda34daa-6a46-4bef-8762-a5d2901a9ae8">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"66cd5060-f5b0-47c4-8=
a6b-3e0510c7aaf7" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eef5fa724229"><strong>BR-05</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1008c674-b235-4b6d-aa44-5fa0b5cfd4d1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f089c989e250">All sensitive EA data updates shall follow a d=
ual-control (Keyer/Verifier) four-eyes approval workflow before changes tak=
e effect.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"89450b3c-c073-41ac-9c4f-5f5ebfb2ea61">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"0f89f0e2-574a-4590-8=
816-6aa1bd30d24f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"acb68606b68f"><strong>BR-06</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"1d652e83-0ce4-46e9-9c17-18ba7c5aefc8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"15217415742f">The system shall enforce Role-Based Access Con=
trol (RBAC) across all functions, data elements, and field-level visibility=
.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"844de8e1-a49c-400d-b42d-fdfea4257de4">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"5f269969-32eb-4974-8=
5ec-7246d9aa3068" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cfe57bafe7d6"><strong>BR-07</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"28f7cfd3-970e-4b13-8cd0-54fd718bb6e8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e26978fdab2a">A full audit trail shall be maintained for all=
 create/update actions including timestamp, actor, <u>source/target system<=
/u>, and result.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"00f35cdc-c031-4da6-9674-b9e4f83f05d3">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"3886995f-f111-4bee-8=
f7e-a60286394253" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"002af5f188aa"><strong>BR-08</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"42451172-b1b5-4177-8e2b-0ef7a1046ce1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d3fdc3444875">The system shall manage EA postcode operating =
areas with PAF validation; classifications: Primary, Secondary, Potential.<=
/p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"d93f356f-775f-4432-ab65-5a2659620d22">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"09790453-e08d-4c6e-8=
985-62db144d9df5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5fdb26b5bf86"><strong>BR-09</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"6b929e59-5908-4383-8b87-9f12940277a0" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1aab26ef99b1">The system shall manage IT asset to EAs with d=
ual-control governance and full audit trails.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"51044f35-894a-4c74-a353-b611017b3131">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"fd9cd993-cc5a-40d9-a=
352-f48caec77415" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b43378d763be"><strong>BR-10</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7f66f106-1f90-46d5-8d5e-907ff174310f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6407e07fdc7d">The system shall provide per-EA integration st=
atus views showing sync success/failure per connected system with detailed =
audit logs.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"04a258d8-ecfd-4e5b-9bdf-9e87117b64d9">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#f2f2f2" data-local-id=3D"611f0931-b061-4e00-8=
b7f-7aa12830dd82" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4d7ef09fd2a1"><strong>BR-11</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"68d134be-c532-4832-ba2e-4da8bf4a8f8c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a28d5334d962">Data retention, archival, and leaver-handling =
processes shall be implemented and enforced per compliance requirements.</p=
></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"a03e3bb4c0d0">&nbsp;</p>
