<p local-id=3D"e6e3d692491f">Note: For some entity in personal details / ce=
rtificates/ Contract / Bonds, Enforcement users could be able to edit certa=
in fields, which will covered in the FRD document.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c483bf8e0bf9">User Journey for RBAC -</p>
<p local-id=3D"98f2ae82250e">If Enforcement Director&nbsp; edits that profi=
le that will got to Contract Service Team Lead for approval&nbsp;<br>
If Sr. Enforcement Manager edit the profile that will goes to Enforcement D=
irector &amp; Contract Service Team Lead for approval&nbsp;<br>
If Enforcement Manager edit the profile that will goes to Enforcement Direc=
tor &amp; Contract Service Team Lead &amp; Sr. EM for the approval&nbsp;<br=
>
Enforcement Officer can be able to edit their own details &amp; view their =
details.&nbsp;<br>
Same as Sr EM can be able to view their assigned Enforcement Managers &amp;=
 Enforcement Officers profile</p>
<p local-id=3D"a7ae25680f7d"></p>
<h1 local-id=3D"e5677684df96" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-10.Assumption=
s,Constraints&amp;Dependencies">10. Assumptions, Constraints &amp; Dependen=
cies</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"48f1e040ec5f" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-10.1Assumptio=
ns">10.1 Assumptions</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"257356df2416">
<li local-id=3D"71c7742ae84f">
<p local-id=3D"80e2377c9949">RBAC roles and their mapping to business funct=
ions will be defined and agreed with stakeholders before build commences.</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7da9804b3a6c">
<p local-id=3D"a629eceb56a3">The Postal Address File (PAF) is accessible fo=
r postcode validation within the platform.&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"61001d96e84f" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-10.2Constrain=
ts">10.2 Constraints</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"2226a9f9513d">
<li local-id=3D"b68627f6471a">
<p local-id=3D"a2876f8c6fd2">The Master EA Platform must not negatively imp=
act the performance of downstream consuming systems during data synchroniza=
tion.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"734f7b3bf62d">
<p local-id=3D"f6dcdfc22f38">All data processing and storage must comply wi=
th applicable data protection regulations (e.g. GDPR, UK DPA 2018).&nbsp;</=
p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"00b034c25ee9" id=3D"MasterEA_Advance_BRD_V1.0-10.3Dependenc=
ies">10.3 Dependencies</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"07b674579df8">
<li local-id=3D"52cbd8b85c9c">
<p local-id=3D"8b8bd65f738d">Availability and readiness of Optimise, Columb=
us, and Advance API interfaces for integration testing.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"39a0a06db5cd">
<p local-id=3D"975d4660c6ff">Completion of data discovery and mapping exerc=
ise for legacy EA records prior to migration.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b538f5bf314a">
<p local-id=3D"1214538e9981">Access to PAF service for postcode validation =
integration.&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
